  "body": "Deadline sale: Closes on Thursday 19 November 2026 at 2:00PM  (unless sold prior)\r\n\r\nDesigned by renowned architect Allan Shanahan, these beautifully crafted residences are ready to move in. With limited opportunities available, now is the perfect time to secure your preferred home in this exceptional boutique development.\r\n\r\nWelcome to 13/27 Hastings Road, an exclusive townhouse offering premium quality, striking architecture and thoughtfully designed spaces in one of the North Shore’s most desirable coastal communities.\r\n\r\nThis home showcases sophisticated design and superior finishes, complemented by an impressive range of modern features, including Premium Kitchen appliances, fibre internet, heating, air conditioning, LED lighting, and an audio-visual intercom. Spacious interiors and abundant natural light create a welcoming atmosphere, while intelligent layouts cater to modern lifestyles.\r\n\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\n\r\n• Generously proportioned three-bedroom, three-bathroom\r\n\r\n• Expansive entertaining deck\r\n\r\n• Single garage for secure parking and storage\r\n\r\n• Fully fenced outdoor area with generous space — a rare advantage for townhouse living\r\n\r\n• Architecturally designed with bold, contemporary styling\r\n\r\n• Clever floor plans maximising space and functionality\r\n\r\n• Premium finishes throughout\r\n\r\n• Durable, low-maintenance cladding suited to coastal environments\r\n\r\n• Double glazing and quality insulation for year-round comfort\r\n\r\n• Master Build Guarantee\r\n\r\nEnjoy the perfect balance of coastal charm and everyday convenience. Just an easy stroll to Mairangi Bay Beach and the vibrant local village, with cafés, shops and amenities close at hand. Families will appreciate the excellent schooling options, including Rangitoto College, Murrays Bay & Mairangi Bay Primary School and Murrays Bay Intermediate.\r\n\r\nA rare opportunity to secure a stylish, architecturally designed home in a premium coastal location. Enquire today to arrange your viewing.",
